WEBVTT

01:27.665 --> 01:31.025
ADAPTED FROM
THE NOVEL MY QUEEN BY XIE LOUNAN

01:37.225 --> 01:39.985
Since you've already seen everything,

01:41.145 --> 01:42.705
then allow me

01:43.345 --> 01:45.225
to send His Majesty off
on his final journey.

01:49.625 --> 01:50.985
Do it.

02:46.305 --> 02:47.585
Ling Jueding, Governor of Jiangzhou,

02:49.625 --> 02:51.305
is here by order to safeguard His Majesty!

03:15.665 --> 03:17.185
The traitors have been eradicated.

03:17.785 --> 03:20.345
Ling Xuefeng, time to come to your senses.

03:27.985 --> 03:29.305
Jueding…

03:31.545 --> 03:34.385
So your business in Xijiang was
just a ruse,

03:35.225 --> 03:36.665
and you slipped back into the Capital

03:38.265 --> 03:41.585
all so you could strike
your own father down!

03:47.265 --> 03:48.105
Father!

03:48.745 --> 03:49.585
You don't have to do this.

03:51.145 --> 03:55.345
I… I don't need your lecture!

04:11.425 --> 04:12.265
Xiao Huan…

04:15.345 --> 04:19.545
You truly are
the finest student I've ever taught.

04:21.184 --> 04:22.865
Today, I am

04:23.585 --> 04:25.025
defeated fair and square.

04:25.865 --> 04:29.945
You ordered Lu Qi to use Ying
to assassinate His Majesty.

04:30.585 --> 04:31.545
When that failed,

04:32.305 --> 04:33.865
you tried one last desperate gamble.

04:34.825 --> 04:35.945
At the Imperial Assembly,

04:36.025 --> 04:37.625
you meant to seize the throne.

04:38.185 --> 04:40.625
Ling Xuefeng, how dare you!

04:46.865 --> 04:50.305
The saying is true.
Victors are kings, losers are nothing.

04:52.505 --> 04:56.145
You want to saddle me
with every crime, old and new.

05:00.945 --> 05:01.785
General Lu.

05:03.985 --> 05:06.225
Should I answer

05:07.345 --> 05:09.225
for these crimes?

05:23.145 --> 05:23.985
Ling Xuefeng!

05:24.065 --> 05:27.065
You ordered me to use Princess Ying

05:27.145 --> 05:29.025
to strike at His Majesty
and commit treason.

05:29.105 --> 05:31.145
You dragged me down with you.
Pay with your life!

07:33.625 --> 07:36.785
Teacher, you've lost in the end.

08:16.625 --> 08:19.105
Considering Father's old age

08:19.185 --> 08:20.985
and the guidance he once gave him,

08:21.065 --> 08:23.985
His Majesty has granted Father leave
to cultivate peace at Fayun Temple

08:24.065 --> 08:26.545
to pray for the Empress's well-being,

08:26.625 --> 08:27.825
and to repent your sins.

08:40.264 --> 08:41.105
Father…

08:43.105 --> 08:44.345
At this point,

08:46.265 --> 08:47.825
there's no turning back.

09:18.225 --> 09:19.225
Tingxin…

09:34.465 --> 09:35.945
The Lu clan has stood loyal
for generations.

09:37.185 --> 09:38.185
Now that you've gone this far,

09:39.225 --> 09:40.305
do you regret it?

09:57.905 --> 09:59.025
Tingxin…

10:03.545 --> 10:04.585
I, Lu Qi,

10:06.185 --> 10:07.705
will never break my word.

10:12.145 --> 10:14.025
For you, I'd gladly give my life.

10:16.625 --> 10:17.785
No regret.

10:23.825 --> 10:24.785
No resentment.

11:07.585 --> 11:08.545
I'm fine.

11:09.465 --> 11:11.025
He'll never get the chance to expose me.

11:37.945 --> 11:38.905
Xiao Huan,

11:39.665 --> 11:42.025
you cost me the best pawn I had.

11:45.265 --> 11:47.425
HEAVEN AND EARTH

11:47.505 --> 11:49.425
Ling Xuefeng knows far too many secrets.

11:50.065 --> 11:50.905
He must…

11:53.945 --> 11:55.745
He must die.

11:58.225 --> 11:59.065
Yes.

12:41.025 --> 12:41.865
Father.

12:44.265 --> 12:45.985
Spring is still bitter and cold.

12:47.105 --> 12:49.505
Your Majesty should be recovering
in the palace.

12:50.305 --> 12:52.345
Why would you come
to see a condemned sinner?

12:58.505 --> 12:59.425
I can't make sense of it.

13:00.465 --> 13:01.585
I truly can't.

13:02.865 --> 13:03.865
Why, Father…

13:05.385 --> 13:06.985
Why did you still choose this path?

13:09.665 --> 13:12.185
His Majesty already allowed you
to retire in peace.

13:15.265 --> 13:16.105
So why?

13:17.185 --> 13:18.625
I, Ling Xuefeng,

13:19.825 --> 13:22.985
spent decades pouring my life
into Great Qi, rising through the court,

13:23.905 --> 13:25.665
clawing my way forward.

13:26.945 --> 13:29.865
Everything I did was for Great Qi.

13:29.945 --> 13:31.305
It was either forward or fall behind.

13:31.985 --> 13:34.145
If I couldn't take a step ahead,

13:34.785 --> 13:36.185
I'd face the same fate

13:36.265 --> 13:39.225
all powerful ministers do.

13:40.345 --> 13:42.185
Homes seized.

13:42.265 --> 13:44.065
Families executed.

13:47.985 --> 13:48.825
Father.

13:50.305 --> 13:51.865
You shouldn't have fought for

13:53.025 --> 13:54.305
what was never yours.

13:56.225 --> 13:58.385
To you, this is ambition.

13:59.945 --> 14:02.105
To me,

14:02.185 --> 14:04.025
it's what my whole life has been.

14:06.025 --> 14:07.425
And now,

14:08.065 --> 14:10.505
what angers me most is

14:11.105 --> 14:13.105
that I was one move away from winning.

14:13.985 --> 14:15.545
But I have no regrets.

14:27.825 --> 14:29.585
Jueding has already asked His Majesty

14:30.385 --> 14:31.865
to lead the entire Ling clan

14:32.425 --> 14:33.425
away from the Capital,

14:34.025 --> 14:35.305
to the cold northern frontiers,

14:35.385 --> 14:38.185
to guard the borders for Great Qi
and never return.

14:44.185 --> 14:45.025
Father.

14:49.905 --> 14:51.185
I've failed you.

14:54.865 --> 14:55.705
From now on…

15:00.345 --> 15:02.385
I can't come to see you again.

15:14.945 --> 15:15.945
I…

15:17.865 --> 15:19.185
thank you

15:20.345 --> 15:21.625
for raising me.

16:00.185 --> 16:01.025
Cangcang!

16:12.385 --> 16:13.625
In my entire life,

16:15.825 --> 16:17.425
the deepest regret

16:18.945 --> 16:21.185
was dragging you into all this.

16:23.745 --> 16:24.865
Back then,

16:26.505 --> 16:28.545
when you didn't want to marry Xiao Huan,

16:30.065 --> 16:31.105
when you wanted to flee the marriage,

16:34.785 --> 16:36.945
I'd wanted to let you go.

16:40.425 --> 16:41.385
Now…

16:44.145 --> 16:45.905
If you still wish to leave,

16:49.185 --> 16:51.065
go with Jueding.

16:53.265 --> 16:54.945
Leave the Capital behind.

17:15.585 --> 17:16.985
All I wish for you

17:17.745 --> 17:19.625
is peace and happiness.

17:25.385 --> 17:27.505
May the Buddha

17:28.505 --> 17:29.985
keep you safe for me.

17:54.065 --> 17:54.905
Father…

18:30.185 --> 18:32.745
My Lady. I will stay here
to watch over your father.

18:32.825 --> 18:34.185
You need not worry.

18:44.905 --> 18:46.025
Father!

18:53.105 --> 18:54.105
Father!

19:44.785 --> 19:46.825
Luo! Luo!

19:48.345 --> 19:49.265
Luo!

19:50.385 --> 19:51.625
How's the injury?

19:53.265 --> 19:54.265
Are you all right?

19:54.945 --> 19:55.865
Cangcang…

19:57.225 --> 19:58.505
I managed to save you

19:59.225 --> 20:02.345
at the last moment.
I have no regrets in this life.

20:04.225 --> 20:06.825
Don't say that. Don't say that!

20:10.745 --> 20:12.625
Stay with me. I'll get you out.

20:12.705 --> 20:15.265
Hold on. Come on. Come on.

20:15.345 --> 20:16.265
Cangcang…

20:17.745 --> 20:18.865
I fear that in the days ahead,

20:19.665 --> 20:21.665
I won't be able to protect you anymore.

20:23.225 --> 20:24.265
Luo Xianxue,

20:25.185 --> 20:26.185
I won't let you die.

20:26.265 --> 20:29.105
You told me you'd stay strong
and keep living for my sake.

20:29.185 --> 20:30.625
You can't break your word.

20:30.705 --> 20:31.825
Do you hear me?

20:33.145 --> 20:33.985
Luo!

20:35.145 --> 20:37.185
Luo! Luo!

20:39.465 --> 20:40.985
-Luo!
-Cangcang,

20:42.105 --> 20:43.225
don't be sad.

20:48.745 --> 20:49.625
Don't cry.

20:50.225 --> 20:51.145
Luo.

20:55.425 --> 20:56.505
Luo.

21:17.585 --> 21:19.945
I, Luo Xianxue, swear to the heavens.

21:20.025 --> 21:21.865
I, Luo Xianxue, swear to the heavens.

21:21.945 --> 21:23.665
From this day on,
I belong to Ling Cangcang.

21:23.745 --> 21:25.625
No matter how hard the road,

21:25.705 --> 21:27.585
for Ling Cangcang's sake,

21:27.665 --> 21:29.465
I'll live on.

21:40.705 --> 21:42.145
Xianxue…

22:09.945 --> 22:13.825
REFUGE IN THE DHARMA REALM

22:13.905 --> 22:15.945
Father. Slowly.

22:32.705 --> 22:33.545
Father!

22:35.305 --> 22:36.225
Father!

22:38.945 --> 22:40.025
Pre…

22:40.105 --> 22:41.025
Father!

22:41.905 --> 22:43.145
Pre…

22:44.945 --> 22:45.905
Father!

22:48.545 --> 22:49.425
Father!

22:50.865 --> 22:52.185
Father!

22:55.505 --> 22:57.465
Father!

23:03.825 --> 23:06.905
YAOQING HALL

23:31.545 --> 23:33.065
Those who truly

23:34.425 --> 23:36.305
cared for me in this world

23:38.385 --> 23:39.905
are all gone.

23:42.545 --> 23:44.545
It's time you tasted

23:45.105 --> 23:47.265
this grief of losing one's own.

24:42.465 --> 24:43.425
Well?

24:45.265 --> 24:46.185
Your Majesty,

24:46.265 --> 24:49.105
the Empress should prepare
for her father's final rites.

25:10.545 --> 25:11.425
Father.

25:31.465 --> 25:34.225
REFUGE IN THE DHARMA REALM

25:55.665 --> 25:58.145
Physician Li is here. Let him try.

26:03.785 --> 26:05.105
Who would dare

26:05.945 --> 26:07.545
strike Father with such cruelty?

26:08.345 --> 26:10.105
Victors are kings.

26:10.185 --> 26:13.825
You want to saddle me
with every crime, old and new.

26:16.025 --> 26:17.225
General Lu.

26:19.665 --> 26:21.545
Should I answer

26:23.025 --> 26:25.065
for these crimes?

26:32.985 --> 26:33.905
During the coup at court,

26:34.825 --> 26:36.585
Ling Xuefeng never fully admitted

26:36.665 --> 26:37.905
that Xiao Ying was sent to kill me.

26:38.825 --> 26:39.665
So I believe

26:40.265 --> 26:42.345
there must be someone
pulling the strings behind him.

26:46.745 --> 26:48.185
When Father was struck by the arrow,

26:49.025 --> 26:50.145
he managed one last word.

26:52.585 --> 26:54.545
But I don't know what he meant to say.

26:56.465 --> 26:59.265
It must be connected
to whoever is behind all this.

27:07.065 --> 27:08.665
To keep Ling Xuefeng safe,

27:08.745 --> 27:11.625
we're keeping him
hidden at Fayun Temple to recover.

27:12.265 --> 27:13.385
But we'll announce

27:13.465 --> 27:15.505
that he succumbed to his injuries.

27:15.585 --> 27:17.105
We'll decide the rest once he wakes.

27:17.705 --> 27:18.945
But Physician Li said

27:19.665 --> 27:21.665
he doesn't know when Father will wake.

27:23.265 --> 27:25.065
And if this person is someone close to us,

27:26.105 --> 27:27.665
wouldn't that spell endless danger?

27:30.065 --> 27:31.345
I have a way

27:31.425 --> 27:33.905
that might reveal the mastermind.

27:43.625 --> 27:45.025
Whatever you plan to do,

27:45.825 --> 27:47.305
I'll be there for you.

27:51.385 --> 27:52.465
Cangcang.

27:53.105 --> 27:55.745
This time, our enemy is hiding
while I'm wide open.

27:56.505 --> 27:57.945
You must promise me

27:58.025 --> 27:59.745
that no matter what happens,

27:59.825 --> 28:01.865
the moment you see the warning arrow,

28:01.945 --> 28:03.345
you must put your own safety first.

28:04.825 --> 28:06.625
-No.
-You must promise me.

28:07.265 --> 28:08.865
Only then can I take the risk.

28:16.025 --> 28:16.865
Fine.

28:18.305 --> 28:19.145
I promise you.

28:39.345 --> 28:40.865
Your Highness!

28:40.945 --> 28:42.745
Your Highness! Slow down, please.

28:45.585 --> 28:46.705
Please, Your Highness.

28:46.785 --> 28:48.145
Put your shoes back on.

28:48.225 --> 28:49.185
If the Prince of Yuzhang sees this,

28:49.265 --> 28:50.225
we'll be…

28:57.905 --> 28:58.785
Your Majesty.

29:02.585 --> 29:03.545
Give me the shoes.

29:19.425 --> 29:22.345
I've heard
that spring is when flowers bloom best

29:22.905 --> 29:24.065
for the beauties.

29:25.665 --> 29:28.265
If you're not dressed nicely,

29:28.345 --> 29:30.625
the flowers might refuse to bloom.

29:39.265 --> 29:40.105
Who are you?

29:50.745 --> 29:51.585
I am…

29:52.625 --> 29:53.865
sent by Li Hongqing

29:53.945 --> 29:56.905
to tell you stories.

29:58.345 --> 29:59.425
Li…

30:00.985 --> 30:01.905
Hong…

30:03.265 --> 30:04.105
Qing…

30:21.905 --> 30:24.385
What we call divination
is really just deduction.

30:24.465 --> 30:27.665
Based on this winter's weather patterns
along the Yellow River,

30:28.345 --> 30:30.065
there won't be major floods this year.

30:30.665 --> 30:32.385
It's a good time to build embankments.

30:32.465 --> 30:33.625
Good.

30:34.585 --> 30:35.425
Well done, Preceptor Du.

30:38.145 --> 30:39.665
It is merely my duty.

30:43.865 --> 30:45.705
Your Majesty has faced one crisis
after another lately.

30:46.465 --> 30:47.705
Your health is already weakened.

30:48.505 --> 30:49.345
Remember,

30:50.465 --> 30:51.505
don't overexert yourself.

30:54.185 --> 30:56.105
The Prince of Yuzhang has arrived.

30:57.345 --> 30:58.185
I shall take my leave.

31:12.705 --> 31:14.265
-Eunuch Feng.
-Madam.

31:14.865 --> 31:17.185
His Majesty's qi and blood
are weak of late.

31:17.705 --> 31:20.865
Regarding the pills,
there are things I need you to remember.

31:21.825 --> 31:22.745
Yes, Madam.

31:31.785 --> 31:33.865
What sort of act are you putting on now?

31:34.865 --> 31:37.665
-I'm here to tell you a secret.
-A secret?

31:39.665 --> 31:40.905
When we were little,

31:41.745 --> 31:43.425
I'd watch you obey Father in everything.

31:44.545 --> 31:46.465
You were up before dawn
to practice and study.

31:48.265 --> 31:49.905
And I'd think to myself,

31:50.945 --> 31:52.145
"This one must be a fool."

31:53.905 --> 31:54.985
But my mother said

31:55.665 --> 31:56.865
the fool was me.

31:57.705 --> 31:59.185
You had ambition.

32:00.385 --> 32:01.665
So later, I asked you.

32:02.265 --> 32:04.065
Do you still remember them?

32:04.745 --> 32:05.945
Of course I remember.

32:06.905 --> 32:09.185
Back then, you really were pretty foolish.

32:12.025 --> 32:14.905
That day,
the pear blossoms were in full bloom.

32:29.945 --> 32:31.865
Where did you steal this wine from now?

32:31.945 --> 32:33.025
You'd better not
let your mother catch you.

32:33.825 --> 32:35.665
Flowers this lovely, wine this fine,

32:35.745 --> 32:37.265
we should be drinking.

32:37.345 --> 32:39.225
And yet, you are practicing like a fool.

32:39.305 --> 32:41.985
Grand Tutor Ling will check our progress.

32:42.065 --> 32:43.105
Have you memorized yours?

32:43.185 --> 32:44.905
Huan,

32:44.985 --> 32:46.185
tell me something.

32:46.265 --> 32:48.705
Are you dead set on becoming Emperor?

32:48.785 --> 32:50.265
So who's the real fool, me or you?

32:56.425 --> 32:57.585
The truth is,

32:58.465 --> 32:59.825
what I've always wanted most

32:59.905 --> 33:01.305
is to live freely,

33:01.385 --> 33:02.825
roaming the martial world with my sword.

33:04.865 --> 33:06.145
But I know

33:06.825 --> 33:08.065
it's only a dream.

33:09.265 --> 33:10.385
And that is a dream

33:11.385 --> 33:12.745
no one cares about.

33:15.505 --> 33:16.625
I care.

33:18.785 --> 33:20.225
I opposed you,

33:20.305 --> 33:21.785
wanting to pull you off the throne.

33:22.545 --> 33:24.705
But in truth,

33:24.785 --> 33:26.665
I thought you were too frail.

33:27.705 --> 33:28.785
You're not suited to rule.

33:29.745 --> 33:32.025
So why not grant your wish?

33:32.105 --> 33:33.265
You can roam the world

33:34.025 --> 33:35.145
and have your freedom.

33:38.665 --> 33:40.345
I care about

33:41.545 --> 33:42.385
your childhood dream.

33:52.265 --> 33:53.105
Well?

33:54.105 --> 33:55.065
Aren't you moved?

33:55.745 --> 33:57.345
Don't you think your younger brother

33:57.425 --> 33:58.945
has a bit of loyalty in him?

34:00.865 --> 34:01.705
A little, I suppose.

34:03.585 --> 34:05.145
Then Your Majesty,
show me your generosity.

34:05.665 --> 34:07.345
Grant me the request I'm about to make.

34:08.585 --> 34:10.985
Speak. What do you want?

34:11.784 --> 34:13.985
If it's something I can give,
you shall have it.

34:16.744 --> 34:18.784
I want to retreat from court
and roam the martial world.

34:19.465 --> 34:21.344
To leave with Ying and Zhong Lin,

34:21.425 --> 34:22.585
and seek out Li Hongqing.

34:23.705 --> 34:25.105
If I find him,

34:25.185 --> 34:26.705
I'll steal away your beloved commander.

34:27.385 --> 34:28.665
If I don't…

34:35.145 --> 34:36.505
If I don't find him,

34:37.025 --> 34:38.625
I'll still do everything
I can to give Ying a happy life.

34:42.905 --> 34:43.744
Well?

34:44.264 --> 34:45.344
Will you allow it or not?

34:47.105 --> 34:48.225
I still need you.

34:49.385 --> 34:52.585
Not anymore.
Your greatest enemy has already fallen.

34:52.665 --> 34:55.824
It's about time
this prince made his grand exit.

35:05.625 --> 35:06.705
This is my royal seal

35:06.785 --> 35:08.985
and the military token
of my Southern Chu fief.

35:09.585 --> 35:10.865
Please keep them safe.

35:22.065 --> 35:23.665
I've thought it all through.

35:24.425 --> 35:25.705
Between the two of us,

35:25.785 --> 35:28.625
one brother should at least
fulfill our shared dream of roaming free.

35:30.345 --> 35:31.185
Isn't that right?

35:32.505 --> 35:35.025
You intend to walk away
with Xiao Ying just like that?

35:36.465 --> 35:38.105
After what was done to her,

35:38.705 --> 35:40.265
don't you want to know the truth?

35:43.185 --> 35:44.345
Wasn't the one who hurt her

35:45.505 --> 35:46.465
Ling Xuefeng?

35:48.745 --> 35:50.825
It's never that simple.

35:51.625 --> 35:53.385
Ling Xuefeng was attacked.

35:53.465 --> 35:54.825
Someone wanted to silence him.

35:55.585 --> 35:56.665
And that someone

35:56.745 --> 35:59.625
is very likely tied
to Xiao Ying's attempt to assassinate me.

36:00.825 --> 36:03.265
Think it over one more time.

36:08.545 --> 36:09.825
Eunuch Feng,
I'll trouble you with this, then.

36:10.425 --> 36:12.705
I hope His Majesty takes care of himself.

36:13.465 --> 36:14.905
We bid you farewell.

36:26.905 --> 36:29.385
You were a gift from Li Hongqing.

36:31.545 --> 36:32.825
So you must bloom soon.

36:36.945 --> 36:37.865
Ying.

36:38.945 --> 36:39.785
You remembered?

36:40.865 --> 36:41.825
Remembered what?

36:43.585 --> 36:44.745
Li Hongqing.

36:47.585 --> 36:49.105
Her Majesty told me.

36:50.585 --> 36:53.345
She told me so many things
about Li Hongqing.

36:55.065 --> 36:56.385
It made me happy,

36:58.825 --> 37:01.905
but somehow, I feel this sadness

37:03.265 --> 37:05.585
in my heart.

37:08.625 --> 37:11.265
You intend to walk away with Xiao Ying?

37:12.665 --> 37:14.265
After what was done to her,

37:14.865 --> 37:16.825
don't you want to know the truth?

37:19.825 --> 37:22.385
Qianqing, who is Li Hongqing?

37:23.025 --> 37:25.065
Why do I feel such a longing to see him?

37:26.065 --> 37:27.705
Can you take me to him?

37:35.745 --> 37:36.585
All right.

37:37.265 --> 37:38.625
I will take you to him.

37:39.465 --> 37:41.625
But you must behave, all right?

38:03.065 --> 38:05.465
This is the Soul-Severing Grass.

38:05.985 --> 38:07.465
It grows inside volcanic craters.

38:08.065 --> 38:10.265
Its fiery nature is extremely potent.

38:10.345 --> 38:13.705
Its heat can force venomous insects
out through the skin and flesh.

38:17.305 --> 38:19.545
Perhaps this Soul-Severing Grass

38:19.625 --> 38:22.265
can drive out the Dual-Pupil parasite
inside Princess Ying

38:23.105 --> 38:24.305
and restore her clarity.

38:24.985 --> 38:26.945
Let me do it. Tell me how.

38:27.025 --> 38:28.665
Your Highness mustn't.

38:28.745 --> 38:30.625
Once the Soul-Severing Flame
touches your skin,

38:30.705 --> 38:32.145
it'll scorch the flesh in an instant.

38:33.425 --> 38:34.705
Ordinary people can't control it.

38:35.625 --> 38:36.465
But…

38:37.905 --> 38:38.825
His Majesty is an exception.

38:42.425 --> 38:43.905
My body runs colder than most.

38:44.465 --> 38:47.185
So this is a task only I can undertake.

38:48.465 --> 38:50.585
The Soul-Severing Flame
must drive the medicinal heat

38:50.665 --> 38:52.425
into the princess's meridians

38:52.505 --> 38:54.345
for the duration of
one joss stick each day.

38:55.065 --> 38:57.585
After three days,
the parasite will leave her body.

38:58.945 --> 38:59.785
However…

39:01.585 --> 39:03.225
His Majesty will deplete
a great deal of inner force.

39:04.585 --> 39:05.785
He may even suffer burns.

39:17.625 --> 39:18.505
It's fine.

40:18.465 --> 40:19.385
Ying.

40:51.545 --> 40:53.465
Ying. Ying!

41:09.265 --> 41:11.425
-Ying! Ying!
-Qianqing…

41:11.505 --> 41:13.105
Your Majesty. Stop.

41:13.185 --> 41:14.505
This is enough. Let's stop here.

41:14.585 --> 41:17.745
The parasite is reacting.
That means the method is working.

41:18.785 --> 41:19.905
Qianqing…

41:20.705 --> 41:22.105
Ying!

41:22.705 --> 41:24.945
-Ying!
-It hurts…

41:29.225 --> 41:32.305
All I see is her pain.
It's sharp and searing,

41:33.425 --> 41:35.145
a torment she can barely endure.

41:35.225 --> 41:36.545
Don't worry.

41:37.185 --> 41:38.305
I won't put her in danger.

41:40.065 --> 41:41.225
However…

41:42.025 --> 41:44.265
Ying is the only one who knows the clues.

41:44.345 --> 41:45.825
You want to walk away halfway.

41:46.425 --> 41:48.825
But I need to know the truth.

41:51.385 --> 41:53.065
Is the truth you're after

41:53.985 --> 41:55.745
worth the pain Ying goes through?

41:57.145 --> 41:58.785
She's not your sister.

41:59.785 --> 42:01.745
Of course you can harden your heart
and look away.

42:02.825 --> 42:03.665
But I can't.

42:05.905 --> 42:07.705
Ying, come with me.

42:07.785 --> 42:08.905
We're leaving.

42:16.705 --> 42:17.745
Move.

42:17.825 --> 42:19.385
You think you're the only one
who sees her as family,

42:20.345 --> 42:21.265
the only one who cares for her?

42:23.025 --> 42:24.385
No one in this world

42:24.985 --> 42:28.345
but Xiao Huan
truly knows what her pain feels like.

42:31.385 --> 42:33.145
He grew up enduring pain
no ordinary man could bear,

42:34.105 --> 42:36.385
all for that gleam of hope
after the storm.

42:39.545 --> 42:41.065
Ying has held on for so long,

42:41.785 --> 42:43.665
and now you want her to give up halfway?

42:43.745 --> 42:44.825
What about everything she endured?

42:44.905 --> 42:47.585
I won't let her suffer another moment.

42:48.705 --> 42:50.305
-I'll care for her all my life.
-Xiao Qianqing!

42:51.425 --> 42:53.145
Wake up.

42:54.505 --> 42:55.985
Ying doesn't remember anything now.

42:58.265 --> 42:59.465
She doesn't remember me.

43:01.345 --> 43:02.745
She doesn't remember us.

43:05.865 --> 43:06.825
She doesn't remember anything.

43:08.025 --> 43:09.745
She doesn't remember Li Hongqing.

43:10.905 --> 43:11.985
Do you really think

43:13.585 --> 43:16.025
she could ever be happy
for the rest of her life?
